		(property "Description" "1 Input Multiplexer  Two universal inputs operate up to 3.1 GHz and accept LVPECL, LVDS, CML, SSTL, HSTL, HCSL (ACcoupled), or single-ended clocks  One crystal input accepts a 10 to 40 MHz crystal or single-ended clock  Two Banks with 2 Differential Outputs each  LVPECL, LVDS, HCSL, or Hi-Z (selectable)  LVPECL Additive Jitter with LMK03806 clock source:  20 fs RMS at 156.25 MHz (10 kHz  1 MHz)  51 fs RMS at 156.25 MHz (12 kHz  20 MHz)  High PSRR: -65 / -76 dBc (LVPECL/LVDS) at 156.25 MH"
